{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31569","headline":"规公业在净名得甚深义仆近获顾长康月宫真影对戴安道所画文殊走笔此篇以屈瞻礼 · 李羣玉","name":"规公业在净名得甚深义仆近获顾长康月宫真影对戴安道所画文殊走笔此篇以屈瞻礼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五浊之世尘冥冥，达观栖心于此经。\n但用须弥藏芥子，安知牛迹笑东溟。\n生公吐辩真无敌，顾氏传神实有灵。\n今日净开方丈室，一飞白足到茅亭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31569.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31569","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}